    "updated_at": "2021-11-10T17:38:30Z",
    "body": "The following fixes the issue for me as workaround (i.e. pre-escaping the `%` in my config).\r\n\r\n```\r\n[character]\r\nsuccess_symbol = \"[%%](blue)\"\r\nerror_symbol = \"[%%](red)\"\r\n```",
